WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:56.760
<b>The Second</b>

38
00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:30.960
Is his arm okay?

39
00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.470
If he took a single step back
his arm would've been ripped off.

40
00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.970
Yeah but he wasn't thinking
about how animal fangs work,

41
00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.640
that'd require a tiny
bit of brain power.

42
00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:41.770
Is he okay...?

43
00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:44.690
You think Big Bro Luffy's
arm will make it?

44
00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:00.120
Hey... Where'd he go?

45
00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.660
Luffy! The sea!

46
00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.500
Huh?

47
00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.420
Hey, look! A shark!

48
00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.630
No, that's Arlong!

49
00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.300
So wait. He went under?

50
00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.230
Oh, crap... This isn't good.

51
00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.350
His abilities double in strength
when he's under water.

52
00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:28.810
Once my momentum in the water
builds up, it's impossible to stop me.

53
00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:34.860
This is precisely the kind of ability that
makes us fishmen all the more superior.

54
00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.820
Did he run away?

55
00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.330
Now... It's time...

56
00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.670
Shark Darts!

57
00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:55.920
Oh, no!

58
00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.010
A torpedo?!

59
00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.970
Something
just flew out of the sea!

60
00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.630
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

61
00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.390
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

62
00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.980
Wow...

63
00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.530
I'm impressed you could dodge that.

64
00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:17.750
Good job.

65
00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.700
But the longer you evade your death,
the more painful it will be.

66
00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:28.660
Shark... Darts!

67
00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.720
Whoa.

68
00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.200
Just what kind of bones does
that crazy shark have?

69
00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.540
His nose crushed the ground!

70
00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:49.850
Shark Darts!

71
00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:09.000
Hey Luffy, hide! Arlong
went into the sea again!

72
00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:13.430
Hurry up, Big Bro!
You gotta hide from him!

73
00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.800
He's setting his sights
on you right now!

74
00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.760
Get outta there!

75
00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.760
I won't hide.

76
00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:29.180
Stop being so stupid!

77
00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.770
Go run for cover before
you become a target!

78
00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.190
No way!
I'm not running anywhere!

79
00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.920
I'm gonna catch him and break his nose!

80
00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.880
C'mon!

81
00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.990
Ya shark!

82
00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.200
You've got some nerve!

83
00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:48.910
Or you realized, that it's
pointless to try and hide from me.

84
00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.410
Didn't you hear us telling you

85
00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.120
that you should go somewhere and hide?!

86
00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.170
You barely escaped his last attacks!

87
00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.550
If he lands just one direct
hit it'll kill you.

88
00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:01.470
Luffy, listen to us! Go and hide!

89
00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.340
Now, Gum-Gum...

90
00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:08.390
... Shield!

91
00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.340
Hey wait! What's that position?

92
00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.230
I don't think that'll stop the attack!

93
00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:15.310
I'll get double the
speed from this distance!

94
00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.480
This time, I'll pierce your
heart rubber man... now...

95
00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:23.110
... take this... Shark Darts!

96
00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:30.490
He's hit!

97
00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:36.920
Heh, heh, heh!

98
00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.210
Huh?!

99
00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.460
Oh, no... Did he get hit?!

100
00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.550
He's fine. He somehow
managed to avoid it.

101
00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.970
It's over!
That attack, won't work now!

102
00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.730
Shark Darts!

103
00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:06.200
You bastard! That was just pure luck!

104
00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.910
Die!

105
00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.100
Fat chance!

106
00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:12.200
Gum-Gum...

107
00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.620
Finger Net!

108
00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.380
Fishy, fishy!

109
00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.220
And...

110
00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:29.800
...Spear!

111
00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.070
Is he dead?

112
00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.490
Do you see the intensity in his eyes?

113
00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.620
Oh, no.

114
00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.790
It's the same expression that
Sea Kings make before they snap.

115
00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:59.290
He must have snapped
with Luffy's last attack!

116
00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:01.840
His eyes...

117
00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.420
... I've never seen them like that.

118
00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.130
You wretched human!

119
00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:13.310
What have you done
to me?! A mighty fishman!

120
00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.320
Whoa... That was crazy...

121
00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:29.280
It didn't actually hurt but I can
tell he's really like... madder...

122
00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.350
Aw, man... What's that?

123
00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.880
The saw blade!

124
00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.420
That thing is gigantic!

125
00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.740
Big Bro Luffy!

126
00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:13.950
He won't stop...
Luffy'll get cornered!

127
00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.170
He jumped in the building!

128
00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.090
The left window.
On the top floor...

129
00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.100
That's the room that...

130
00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.140
There's nowhere else to run!

131
00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.270
You and me... Here...

132
00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:44.550
... in the highest level of Arlong Park.

133
00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:46.650
What is this room?

134
00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.030
Lotta paper.

135
00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:50.360
This isn't just any room.

136
00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:55.410
This is the room where I make Nami
draw all of her sea charts for me.

137
00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.910
The map room!

138
00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.660
This is Nami's room...

139
00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.830
These sea charts are what she's
worked on all these years.

140
00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.380
There is no one else on
the face of the planet

141
00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.970
that can draw sea charts with
such accuracy and efficiency.

142
00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.430
That young lady has a gift.

143
00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:26.590
And there really isn't anything as ultimately
regrettable as wasting natural talent.

144
00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:29.730
Staying here and drawing up
sea charts for me is her

145
00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.320
only chance at living up
to her full potential!

146
00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:36.530
This pen is stained with blood.

147
00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.240
In order for me to
attain world supremacy.

148
00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:43.830
Her sea charts are absolutely vital!

149
00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:48.130
She will continue drawing her
sea charts for my own ambitions!

150
00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:52.630
And once her charts give me full
knowledge of all the world's oceans,

151
00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:55.680
we fishmen will be totally invincible!

152
00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:58.680
And the world shall kneel before us!

153
00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.640
The first step is this island.

154
00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.770
Then we'll move on to
the whole East Blue.

155
00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.230
Hm.

156
00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:12.190
You could never use her like me!
She would be wasted on you!

157
00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.370
What the...? The Shark Saw!

158
00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:25.250
It won't budge!

159
00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:29.960
No!

160
00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.420
Use her?!

161
00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.760
What's happening?
Are they still fighting?

162
00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.310
What's going on up there?!
Dammit Big Bro Luffy!

163
00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.390
Are you okay...?

164
00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.480
I wish we knew
what was goin' on up there.

165
00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.520
Luffy...

166
00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.360
You bastard!

167
00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.730
What do you take her for?!

168
00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:58.030
She's an inferior creature,

169
00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.560
but she has risen far above her peers.

170
00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.700
If all other humans are sewer rats,
than she's a feisty little kitten.

171
00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:06.960
After all she is adorable.

172
00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.620
She has her place and
it's here beside me.

173
00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.420
Can't you understand that?

174
00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.460
I can give her everything she needs.

175
00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:19.300
And the only thing she has
to do is continue drawing

176
00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.260
those marvelous charts for me.

177
00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:28.200
So Nami will forever
be my tool... or no...

178
00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.850
... she'll be my friend.

179
00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.280
Huh?

180
00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.320
Uh! What is that?!

181
00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.240
A desk?

182
00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.700
It's a desk.

183
00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.760
It's okay... It was just a desk.

184
00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.080
Man I was scared...

185
00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.780
I thought that was
Big Bro Luffy for sure.

186
00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:54.780
Hold on!

187
00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:57.450
I don't wanna hear that
kind of talk from you!

188
00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:58.710
Have you lost your faith?

189
00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.470
What?! No!

190
00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.710
You were scared too, Johnny!

191
00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.850
Don't be stupid! I just, uh...

192
00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:04.850
Well, you know...

193
00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.020
I thought it was Arlong
flying through the air.

194
00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.130
What a load of crap!
You were scared! Admit it!

195
00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:11.930
Admit what, you jerk?!

196
00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.900
Admit that I know Arlong's goin' down?!

197
00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.530
There's no way that Big Bro
Luffy is gonna lose this fight!

198
00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.360
Luffy...

199
00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.700
What do you think you're doing?!

200
00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:23.870
Whoa! What's goin' on?!

201
00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.410
Why's all that stuff being
thrown outta there?!

202
00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:40.220
Alright. As of today,
this will be your room.

203
00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.840
Your desk. Your pens.

204
00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.970
Everything you'll need is in here.

205
00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.730
Stop it now!

206
00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.940
The charts!

207
00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.150
My charts!

208
00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.400
Dumb brat... You can't
trick me that easily.

209
00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:05.740
Trying to draw up fake charts.

210
00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.080
I can't believe you waste your
time drawing crap like this in secret.

211
00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.710
Huh...?

212
00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.290
If you ever try to
pull a stunt like this again,

213
00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.300
I'll drag all those villagers in here,

214
00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:22.010
and make you watch as I
crush every single one...

215
00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.630
... just like with her.

216
00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.060
Damn you!

217
00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.560
That's eight year's worth of work!

218
00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.650
Eight years of planning and ambition!

219
00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:43.450
Bellemere... Nojiko...

220
00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.270
Wow... This fight is
so freakin' intense.

221
00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.830
Yeah... A fight to the death.

222
00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:55.790
Definitely.

223
00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.680
Thank you.

224
00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:14.890
Now you've gone too far!

225
00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:21.400
You keep jabbering on about
how much better fishmen are,

226
00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.610
and how much you need
those sea charts...

227
00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:27.160
I don't understand anything
about that stuff,

228
00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.780
but, I finally figured
out how to save her!

229
00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:39.600
This room isn't anything
but her jail cell.

230
00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.070
There's only one way
for Nami to escape.

231
00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:44.470
I've got to tear this place apart!

232
00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.340
Gum-Gum...!

233
00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:48.930
You fool...

234
00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.720
Arlong Park cannot be brought
down by some inferior human.

235
00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.140
Especially not by some
rubbery freak like you!

236
00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:58.810
Shark Tooth Drill!

237
00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.520
Battle-Axe!

238
00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.900
Oh, no! It looks like Arlong
Park is coming down!

239
00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:51.730
It's gonna collapse!

240
00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:54.800
Everybody run for cover!

241
00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.180
Big Sis! We gotta go!

242
00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.550
But Luffy's still inside!

243
00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.250
Big Sis!

244
00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.750
We can't! Luffy's still...!

245
00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.590
Luffy!

246
00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:22.060
Luffy...

247
00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.400
Luffy...

248
00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.430
What the hell? What's that noise?

249
00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.470
Luffy...

250
00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:15.280
Arlong Park has... fallen...

251
00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.480
Big Bro...

252
00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:20.660
I just wonder what went on in there?

253
00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.050
We gotta know who won.

254
00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:26.630
With all that debris... Looks like...

255
00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.300
Luffy...

256
00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.020
It's Luffy!

257
00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.850
Big Bro!

258
00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:51.650
He's just standing there... What's wrong?

259
00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.870
Nami!

260
00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:12.710
Nami! You'll always be my friend!

261
00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.180
Yeah.

262
00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:36.030
All
heart
in
me,
my

263
00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:31.540
All that's

264
00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:34.340
I

265
00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:34.650
cannot

266
00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:33.100
